rows=[
('ast_cochain/__init__.py',52,'Explicit lazy exports and cached imports only; names phi/gamma/exactness do not establish computations.'),
('ast_cochain/ast_cochain_extractor.py',40,'Facade parses/builds a graph then calls the functional-refusing evaluator, including empty input. Empty layer-rule mapping falls back to defaults. No Python fallback returns named functional values here.'),
('ast_cochain/ast_dependency_complex.py',155,'Builds a floating weighted directed graph from heuristic import resolution, labels outward dependencies by declared rank and reciprocal imports by1, and distributes syntax-error weight over edges. It fabricates a zero-weight chain/self-loop when imports are absent, so graph is not solely source dependency edges. Resolver picks the first prefix/suffix match rather than most-specific absolute module; collected parent and imported-name targets can duplicate edges. Relative import semantics are not reconstructed. Transitive triangles supply +,+,- incidence rows; absent faces are represented by one zero row. This is an admitted architecture model, not exact source semantics or physical cohomology.'),
('ast_cochain/ast_metrics_evaluator.py',55,'verify_exactness actually checks only floating tolerance d1*d0≈0, not exactness im(d0)=ker(d1). Shape failures return false; tolerance is caller-supplied/unvalidated. All named PHI/GAMMA2/evaluate/empty-report entrypoints delegate to require_rust_functional refusal boundary. No native computation was executed in this review.'),
('ast_cochain/ast_models.py',45,'ASTDefect and mutable ASTEvaluationReport are passive records; weights/counts/flags/hash/authority are unvalidated. to_dict rounds numerical values to6places while preserving supplied exact/closed flags, so presentation does not prove exactness or source binding.'),
('ast_cochain/ast_source_parser.py',67,'ast.parse without source execution, all ast.walk imports including nested/dead branches; SyntaxError becomes weight2 defect. ImportFrom ignores level and entirely omits from-dot-import with module=None; function/class symbol names lose scope. No dynamic import analysis, resource caps or provenance digest. Result frozen only shallowly around mutable maps/sets/ASTs.'),
('ast_cochain/models.py',97,'Separate LGGR receipt requires Fraction-valued defect fields and exact zero property, but no nonnegativity, count, verdict-consistency, authority or source/witness binding. DependencyEdge fields likewise passive. Supplied weights/metrics are not proved graph invariants merely by their names.'),
('value_objects/topology.py',105,'Strict nonnegative integer vertex/matrix/half-open-span wrappers; edges allow loops and do not bind to a carrier. ByteSpan permits empty spans. contains/overlaps are correct half-open arithmetic, but slice indexes Python Unicode characters despite byte-offset contract, so multibyte strings select different content. MatrixShape has no resource cap and is not a matrix proof.')]
